	<string>XCeleration uses the camera to scan the QR code on a teammate&apos;s phone, so you can pass a race, finish times or bib numbers between your phones.</string>
	<key>NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Lets XCeleration find your coach&apos;s and teammates&apos; phones nearby, to send races, finish times and bib numbers between them without the internet.</string>
	<key>NSLocationAlwaysAndWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>When you tap the location button on a race, XCeleration uses where you are to fill in the race&apos;s address for you. It is used only then, and you can always type the address instead.</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
